BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Prague//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Prague — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Svíčková na smetaně — Braised beef\, root-vegetable cream sauce\, bread dumplings\, cranberries\, whipped cream.
DESCRIPTION:Say: SVEECH-ko-vah. First printed in Rettigová's Domácí kuchařka\, 1826\; the name is from svíčka\, candle\, the shape of the tenderloin. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá\, 325 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá\, 325 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Vepřo knedlo zelo — Roast pork with caraway\, sauerkraut\, bread dumplings.
DESCRIPTION:Say: VEP-rzho KNED-lo ZEH-lo. The name is the three ingredients with their endings clipped off\, which is exactly how it is ordered. Best: U Pinkasů\, Jungmannovo náměstí 16 (check the day's menu)
LOCATION:U Pinkasů\, Jungmannovo náměstí 16 (check the day's menu)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Pinkas%C5%AF+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Hovězí guláš s knedlíkem — Beef shin goulash with dumplings\, the pub's everyday plate.
DESCRIPTION:Say: HO-vyeh-zee GOO-lahsh. Czech guláš is thicker than Hungarian gulyás and exists to be mopped up with dumplings\, not eaten as soup. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá\, 305 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá\, 305 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Smažený sýr — Breaded fried cheese\, tartar sauce\, potatoes.
DESCRIPTION:Say: SMAH-zheh-nee seer. A luxury at the Grand Hotel Šroubek in Masaryk's day\; the 1960s canteens made it the nation's meatless default. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá\, farm eidam from Struhy\, 315 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá\, farm eidam from Struhy\, 315 CZK (27 Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Tatarák s topinkami — Raw beef tartare with fried bread you rub with raw garlic.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TAH-tah-rahk. The topinka\, not the beef\, is the Czech part: bread fried in fat and scraped with a garlic clove until the clove is gone. Best: U Zlatého tygra\, 150 g with 6 topinky\, 240 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
LOCATION:U Zlatého tygra\, 150 g with 6 topinky\, 240 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Obložený chlebíček — The open sandwich of two or three bites: potato salad\, ham\, egg\, gherkin.
DESCRIPTION:Say: OB-lo-zheh-nee KHLEH-bee-chek. Credited to Jan Paukert's delicatessen on Národní\, opened 1916\, for a painter who found canapés too small. Best: Lahůdky Zlatý kříž\, Jungmannova 34 (reopened 2025\; 49 CZK classic at reopening)
LOCATION:Lahůdky Zlatý kříž\, Jungmannova 34 (reopened 2025\; 49 CZK classic at reopening)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lah%C5%AFdky+Zlat%C3%BD+k%C5%99%C3%AD%C5%BE+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Pražská šunka — Prague ham by weight\, with butter and a gherkin.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PRAHZH-skah SHOON-kah. An EU Traditional Speciality Guaranteed since 2018\; its inventor (Zvěřina\, 1857 or 1870) is still argued over. Best: U Zlatého tygra\, 100 g\, 90 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
LOCATION:U Zlatého tygra\, 100 g\, 90 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-8@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Utopenec — Pickled sausage with onion and chilli\, eaten cold with bread.
DESCRIPTION:Say: OO-toh-peh-nets. 'The drowned man': the pub legend says its inventor\, a Beroun-district miller named Šamánek\, drowned mending his mill wheel. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá\, own špekáček\, 129 CZK (Sept 2026)\; U Zlatého tygra\, 85 CZK
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá\, own špekáček\, 129 CZK (Sept 2026)\; U Zlatého tygra\, 85 CZK
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-9@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Nakládaný hermelín — Czech camembert pickled in oil with garlic\, paprika\, onion\, chilli.
DESCRIPTION:Say: NAH-klah-dah-nee HER-meh-leen. The name Hermelín (ermine\, for the white rind) was registered in 1946 because camembert was taken. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-10@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Pivní sýr — Pungent beer cheese you mash with butter\, mustard\, onion and a splash of beer.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PIV-nee seer. U Zlatého tygra says the beer-cheese maker supplied it before any other pub: 'the era of beer cheese began here'. Best: U Zlatého tygra\, 90 g\, 110 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
LOCATION:U Zlatého tygra\, 90 g\, 110 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-11@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Bramborák — Garlicky potato pancake\, marjoram in the batter.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BRAHM-bo-rahk. At the Tygr it is used as a jacket: a pork schnitzel wrapped inside the bramborák. Best: U Zlatého tygra\, řízek v bramboráku 190 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
LOCATION:U Zlatého tygra\, řízek v bramboráku 190 CZK (menu seen Sept 2026)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-12@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Tankové pivo\, hladinka — Unpasteurised Pilsner Urquell from cellar tanks\, poured with a thick wet head.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TAHN-ko-veh PIV-o\, HLAH-din-kah. Pilsner was first brewed on 5 October 1842 by Josef Groll in Plzeň: the first golden lager anywhere. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá\, 12 tanks\, up to 1\,300 guests a day
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá\, 12 tanks\, up to 1\,300 guests a day
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-13@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Mlíko — A glass of beer foam\, drunk in one go.
DESCRIPTION:Say: MLEE-ko. Only possible on the side-pull LUKR tap\; the named pours were codified and promoted by Pilsner Urquell and Ambiente over the last two decades. Best: Lokál Dlouhááá (ask at the tap)
LOCATION:Lokál Dlouhááá (ask at the tap)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lok%C3%A1l+Dlouh%C3%A1%C3%A1%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-14@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Plzeň at U Pinkasů — A Pilsner where Prague first drank one.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PIN-kah-soo. On 8 April 1843 the coachman Martin Salzmann carried two buckets of the new Plzeň lager here for Jakub Pinkas to taste. Best: U Pinkasů\, Jungmannovo náměstí 16\, daily 10:00–22:30
LOCATION:U Pinkasů\, Jungmannovo náměstí 16\, daily 10:00–22:30
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Pinkas%C5%AF+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-15@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Plzeň at U Zlatého tygra — The 12-degree Pilsner in Bohumil Hrabal's regular pub.
DESCRIPTION:Say: OO ZLAH-teh-ho TIG-rah. The house will not sell you a spirit\; Hrabal drank here for decades and brought Clinton and Havel. Best: U Zlatého tygra\, Husova 17\, daily 15:00–23:00\; book on +420 222 221 111
LOCATION:U Zlatého tygra\, Husova 17\, daily 15:00–23:00\; book on +420 222 221 111
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-16@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Burčák — Half-fermented new wine\, cloudy and sweet\, still working in the glass.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BOOR-chahk. Legal only from 1 August to 30 November\, and only from Czech grapes of that year's harvest. Best: Vinograf\, Senovážné náměstí 23 (Mon–Fri 11:30–24:00\, Sat from 16:00)
LOCATION:Vinograf\, Senovážné náměstí 23 (Mon–Fri 11:30–24:00\, Sat from 16:00)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vinograf+Senov%C3%A1%C5%BEn%C3%A9+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-17@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Becherovka — Karlovy Vary herbal bitters\, drunk chilled.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BEH-kheh-rov-kah. Sold since 1807 as 'English Bitter' by the pharmacist Josef Becher\; about 20 herbs\, recipe still secret. Best: Any pivnice (not at U Zlatého tygra\, which serves no spirits)
LOCATION:Any pivnice (not at U Zlatého tygra\, which serves no spirits)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Any+pivnice+%28not+at+U+Zlat%C3%A9ho+tygra+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-18@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Točená Kofola — The socialist cola\, on draught.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TOH-cheh-nah KO-fo-lah. Designed 1959–60 by Zdeněk Blažek's team from 14 herbal and fruit ingredients plus caffeine\; first bottled in Prague in March 1960. Best: Most pubs\; ask for točená
LOCATION:Most pubs\; ask for točená
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Most+pubs%3B+ask+for+to%C4%8Den%C3%A1+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-19@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Věneček and větrník — Choux ring with custard cream\; the big caramel-glazed choux 'windmill'.
DESCRIPTION:Say: VYEH-neh-chek\, VYET-rneek. Myšák's shop on Vodičkova opened in 1904\; Café Savoy keeps větrník on its patisserie list. Best: Myšák\, Vodičkova 710/31 (věneček)\; Café Savoy\, Vítězná 5 (větrník)
LOCATION:Myšák\, Vodičkova 710/31 (věneček)\; Café Savoy\, Vítězná 5 (větrník)
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=My%C5%A1%C3%A1k+Vodi%C4%8Dkova+Praha
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:prague-liste-20@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Macharův dort — Chocolate cake named for a poet.
DESCRIPTION:Say: MAH-khah-roov dort. Named in 1919 for Josef Svatopluk Machar\, a Myšák regular\; still made to the house recipe. Best: Myšák\, Vodičkova 710/31
LOCATION:Myšák\, Vodičkova 710/31
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=My%C5%A1%C3%A1k+Vodi%C4%8Dkova+Praha
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
